{"ref":"BDB, בָּלַג","hw":"בָּלַג","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">בָּלַג</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. gleam, smile (</strong>Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">بَلِجَ</span> <strong>)</strong>—only<br><strong>Hiph.</strong>  Impf. 1 s. c. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְ</span> subord. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְאַבְלִ֫יגָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 9:27\" href=\"/Job.9.27\">Jb 9:27</a> + 2 times; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַבְלִיג</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 5:9\" href=\"/Amos.5.9\">Am 5:9</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>shew a smile, look cheerful</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 39:14\" href=\"/Psalms.39.14\">ψ 39:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 9:27\" href=\"/Job.9.27\">Jb 9:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 10:20\" href=\"/Job.10.20\">10:20</a>. <strong>2.</strong>  <em>cause to burst</em> or <em>flash</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">המב׳ שֹׁד על־עָ֑ז</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 5:9\" href=\"/Amos.5.9\">Am 5:9</a> (cf. Ew St).","next":"BDB, בִּלְגָּה","prev":"BDB, בַּלְאֲדָן"}